<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT QUARTER FINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT QUARTER FINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter finals results on the fifth day of the $750,000 men's Rotterdam World Indoor tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-4 1-6 6-3</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat 8-Petr Korda (Czech Republic), Korda withdrew injured  </p>
<p>3-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany) 7-6 (10-8) 6-3</p>
<p>2-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Michael Stich (Germany) 7-6 (7-4) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
</text>
